<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Localiser Probe Calibration</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="heading11" lang="EN-GB">Localiser Probe Calibration is necessary</span> <span class="subheading11" lang="EN-GB">to</span> <span class="heading11" lang="EN-GB">maintain a high degree of accuracy.</span></p>
<p class="sub-head">FARO Single Hole Probe Calibration</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Exit KUBE.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Run Caliper.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Select</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Settings &gt; Probes</b></i></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Enter the correct probe diameter.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">For best results, select Single Hole Calibration.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Follow the on-screen instructions to capture 20 points:</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">Capturing <b>POINT 1</b>:</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<table class="TableGrid" style="border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:5px; margin-left:48px;" cellspacing="5">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1025" src="single_hole_calib2.jpg" width="120px" height="120px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1026" src="single_hole_calib3.jpg" width="120px" height="120px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB">Press front button</span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB">Press back button</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="Normal">&#160;</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle">Capturing <b>POINT 2</b></p>
</li>
</ul>
<table class="TableGrid" style="border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:5px; margin-left:48px;" cellspacing="5">
<col>
<col>
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1027" src="single_hole_calib4.jpg" width="120px" height="121px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1028" src="single_hole_calib1.jpg" width="120px" height="119px" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1029" src="single_hole_calib2.jpg" width="120px" height="120px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1030" src="single_hole_calib3.jpg" width="120px" height="120px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">Rotate the localiser probe</font></span></p>
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">approximately 36 degrees</font></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">Hold for 0.5 seconds.</font></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">Press front button.</font></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">Press back button.</font></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Repeat the process for <b>POINT 3</b> to <b>POINT 10</b>.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Capturing <b>POINT 11</b>:</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<table class="TableGrid" style="border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0px; margin-left:48px;" cellspacing="0">
<tr>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1031" src="single_hole_calib5.jpg" width="120px" height="121px" border="0" class="img_whs10" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1032" src="single_hole_calib6.jpg" width="120px" height="120px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1033" src="single_hole_calib7.jpg" width="120px" height="120px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1034" src="single_hole_calib8.jpg" width="120px" height="119px" border="0" class="img_whs11" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">Flip the localiser probe to the</font></span></p>
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">opposite position (approximately</font></span></p>
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">135 degrees).</font></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">Hold for 0.5 seconds</font></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">Press front button.</font></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:9.0pt;"><font size="1" style="font-size:9pt;">Press back button.</font></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Repeat the process for <b>POINT 12</b> to <b>POINT 20</b>.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Once Probe Calibration is complete, proceed with a <a href="../localiser_performance_check.htm" style="font-size:10pt;">Localiser Performance Check.</a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
